{"id":"streit","lemma":"Streit","pos":"noun","rank":1183,"glosses":["quarrel, dispute, fight, argument","fight, battle"],"ipa":"/ʃtʁaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/De-Streit.ogg/De-Streit.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Streites","plural":"Streite"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir hatten Streit.","en":"We had a fight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/178197","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null]},{"text":"Wer hat mit dem Streit angefangen?","en":"Who started the fight?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756252","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"anfangen"}]},{"text":"Du suchst Streit.","en":"You're asking for trouble.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to search, to look for","l":"suchen"},null]},{"text":"Worum ging es bei dem Streit?","en":"What was the fight over?","words":[{"g":"about what"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Sie streitet nur um des Streites willen.","en":"She argues just for the sake of arguing.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to argue","l":"streiten"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"will","l":"Wille"}]}]}